 the error rate down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the before and after state, the approval, and the version to roll back to if needed (v2.3.0, the last version that was healthy in production). Opening it paged the on-call engineer.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_019kc3XGU9WJGWnm9TpbExLo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FoAQ6EnzaJ9TjMD7YWriy4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01SD1hkC79cAFuALN3F7bwSb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.2"}, "name": "deploy", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Veen9L4WmVFyLrmEWRQQek", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016YDgB216EgaDk6yR9Uat7s", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014z53zrgeDk26J2fEk4o46N", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api hotfix v2.3.2 deployed to all production regions", "severity": "SEV3", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "Change record: checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, which was unhealthy with an 18% error rate. Hotfix v2.3.2 had never run in production, so the change manager approved it before it went out. It is now live in all three regions. After rollout the service is healthy with a 0.2% error rate. Last known-good rollback target: v2.3.0.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.2-hotfix-deploy-record"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The checkout-api hotfix v2.3.2 is now live in all production regions (us-east, us-west and eu-west), and I opened SEV3 incident INC-0001 to record the change.\n\n- **Before:** All three regions were running v2.3.1, which was unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- **Approval:** v2.3.2 had never run in production before, so policy required the change manager to sign off. The request went to them automatically and they approved it.\n- **After:** The service is healthy, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the before and after state, the approval, and the version to roll back to if needed (v2.3.0, the last version that was healthy in production). Opening it paged the on-call engineer.", "type": "text"}]}]}